WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.800
Manon waits as Ryu falls from his blocked Shoryuken.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.700
Heavy Dégagé catches Ryu’s recovery as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.450
Manon spends three Super stocks on Level 3.

4
00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:11.950
Level 3 continues the punish.

5
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.900
The final throw completes the Level 3 cinematic.

6
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.450
Ryu recovers after the Super finish.
